                <p>
                    <lb n="1"/>kō-vicaiya-kampa-vikkirama-parumaṟk<choice><orig>i</orig><reg>u</reg></choice>
                    <lb n="2"/>yāṇṭu Irupatt’ āṟ-āvatu
                </p>
                
                <p>
                    pa
                    <lb n="3" break="no"/>l-kuṉṟa-k-kōṭṭattu teṉṉāṟṟū
                    <lb n="4" break="no"/>r-nāṭṭu-k kuḷattūr vāṇiyar caya-va
                    <lb n="5" break="no"/>llavaṉ kuḷattūr Ūrār pakkal vi
                    <lb n="6" break="no"/>ṟṟu-k koṇṭu Ēri-<supplied reason="omitted">p</supplied>-paṭṭi ceyta caḻai
                    <lb n="7" break="no"/>yāppāṟai-c ceṟuvu Ēri-p-paṭṭi ceytatu		
                </p>
                
                <p>
                    <lb n="8"/>Itukku Eṉṟu<unclear>m</unclear> kuttukkāl kātt’ ū
                    <lb n="9" break="no"/>ṭṭiṉṉā<supplied reason="omitted">r</supplied> Aṭi-y eṉ muṭi mēl
                </p>	
                
